For your RMSEA question, I suggest Savelei (2018)
https://www.tandfonline.com/doi/abs/10.1080/00273171.2018.1455142?casa_token=jgQayI_0U3MAAAAA:3o3Cnf36K23X88gfquHTvhCwenZy8SFig4_aMc9e5SywITMnzSEDYQqJOkwTBOWp30M97_lZm4VJ
Apparently, while you could report the scaled RMSEA, its interpretation would be unclear; therefore, it would be more correct to report the robust value.

In the multigroup analysis, you added a free residual covariance. Since this is the one change, it might be the root of the issue. Try removing it.

